			"date": "2024-10-23T14:57:18.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I find it interesting that, even in low-ceremony western societies, we often avoid saying “no”: “I’m too busy at the moment”, etc.</p>",
