			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I wish explicit “no” were more common (I’m not good at it either). Sometimes people rather say nothing than say “no”. And then you’re never 100% sure what to think.</p>",
